| `launcher.long_after_seconds` | integer | `600` | a whole number of seconds, 1 or more | `scripts/launch.py` (`load_launcher_config`); `script_length` | Sets the duration above which a script's last recorded run makes it long though unlisted; only a run that succeeded within it makes a script short, and a failed or interrupted run within it leaves the script unknown. | how long a farm job may run: `launcher.long_scripts.<name>.minutes` | always |
